  "content": "<div>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kB46TvP.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"112\">此模组为游戏增添筏子。</p>\n<p>你可以用任意3个原木和一些线来制作这些浮木，它们是您Minecraft水域的绝佳补充。</p>\n<p>目前有6种类型的筏子，每种对应一种原木。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模组是源于Darkosto提出几周的构想。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz Partner\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要服务器吗？使用促销代码“mrbysco”首月享受20%折扣</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如有疑问，欢迎加入我的Discord。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord Link\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;<strong>想支持我们吗？</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp;-Mrbysco</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp;-ShyNieke</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
